{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3437","id":4345490051,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz888AAAABAwLqgw","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3437","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3437.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3437.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3437","number":3437,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"dns: cancel extra-records retry on shutdown","user":{"login":"SebTardif","id":1413412,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTM0MTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1413412?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SebTardif","html_url":"https://github.com/SebTardif","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SebTardif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SebTardif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SebTardif/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SebTardif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SebTardif/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SebTardif/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SebTardif/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SebTardif/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SebTardif/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"When `dns.extra_records_path` is deleted or atomically replaced, the filewatcher retry can ignore shutdown for up to 15 minutes. This change cancels that retry on `Close` and closes the watcher if setup fails.\n\n## Problem\n\n`NewExtraRecordsManager` starts an `fsnotify` watcher and `Run` re-attaches after `Remove`/`Rename` with `backoff.Retry`. That retry used `context.Background()`, so `Close()` (called from `Serve` shutdown) could not abort it. backoff v5's default budget is 15 minutes.\n\nIf the file is still missing after that budget, the old loop continued without `watcher.Add`. A later recreate of the same path was never seen. That is a delayed return of the watch-loss bug fixed in #2298 for editor atomic saves.\n\nSetup errors after `fsnotify.NewWatcher()` also returned without `watcher.Close()`, leaking the watcher FD and its internal goroutine.\n\n## Change\n\n- Cancel the path-exists retry when `closeCh` is closed.\n- After a failed retry that is not shutdown, watch the parent directory so a later recreate is observed.\n- Close the watcher on every `NewExtraRecordsManager` error path after `NewWatcher` succeeds.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Red: `go test ./hscontrol/dns/ -run TestWaitUntilPathExistsReturnsOnClose` failed in 2s without the cancel (`waitUntilPathExists did not return after Close`).\n- Green: `go test -race ./hscontrol/dns/` passes.\n- `gofmt` and `golangci-lint run ./hscontrol/dns/` are clean.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] have read the [CONTRIBUTING.md](./CONTRIBUTING.md) file\n- [x] added unit tests\n- [x] updated CHANGELOG.md\n\nRef #2289\n","created_at":"2026-08-24T04:49:42Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T09:35:46Z","closed_at":"2026-09-04T09:35:45Z","merged_at":"2026-09-04T09:35:45Z","merge_commit_sha":"acb9fafdedcf185db568a0334ca3501f3951a1a0","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"nblock","id":131119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTExOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock","html_url":"https://github.com/nblock","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/repos","events_url":"https: